hey thanks for opened issue, i looked into this and the behavior is actually correct.

  the issue is that napi_coerce_to_string can throw a new exception when it fails. since { proto: null } has no toString method, calling napi_coerce_to_string on it throws a TypeError.

  so whats happening:
  napi_get_and_clear_last_exception clears the original exception (works fine)
  napi_coerce_to_string then throws a NEW exception
  this new exception stays pending

  i verified this locally:
  after clear: exception pending = false
  after coerce_to_string: status = 3 (pending_exception), exception pending = true

  you can test in plain js: String({ proto: null }) throws TypeError

  fix:
```cpp
  } else {
      napi_value ignored;
      napi_get_and_clear_last_exception(env, &ignored);
      // print generic error message
  }
```
