I’ve reproduced this issue in Node.js v23.11.0 with a minimal test case involving top-level await, dynamic import(), and a circular dependency. Unlike #55468, where Deno also fails, Deno succeeds here, highlighting a Node.js-specific ESM loader bug.

Platform: 

Debian GNU/Linux 12 (bookworm), 6.6.67-06628-g571b599e617d, aarch64 (Chromebook)

Directory Structure:

```text
folder/
├── package.json
├── main.js
├── mod.js
```

package.json:

```json
