```

Regardless on whether it's the method used in the binding, using `Uint32Value` to extract the arguments doesn't seem right.

[This method follows](https://github.com/nodejs/node/blob/ee46d2297c648dc6cc8cbc0327c453514b878294/src/node_buffer.cc#L584), also taking in `uint32_t`s:
